      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please do not put butter or Vaseline on the burn, as these can trap heat and increase the risk of infection. Immediately run cool (not ice-cold) tap water over the burned area for at least 10 to 20 minutes to stop the burning process. After cooling, cover the burn loosely with a sterile, non-stick bandage, and seek medical attention if the blisters are large or the pain is severe.",
