      "content": "my mom always says that heavy ointments are better because they seal everything in and stop it from drying out. if i just use a really heavy duty antibiotic ointment and wrap it tight with gauze, it'll stay protected and won't get infected, right? i really just need to know if that's a safe way to handle it at home so i can avoid the hospital.",
